      "text": "用ＬＰ支付",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "shop_restaurant_con_00_04",
      "hash64": "5FDFD3A6D64D1720",
      "text": "取消",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "msg_restaurant01_00",
      "hash64": "DBD94FBDDF96632C",
      "text": "夹饱堡欢迎您\\n一来二去，三～明治！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "msg_restaurant01_01",
      "hash64": "DBD950BDDF9664DF",
      "text": "您要点的是\\n[VAR 0x01CF(0000)]吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "01CF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "msg_restaurant01_02",
      "hash64": "DBD951BDDF966692",
      "text": "现在的食力将会被覆盖哦。\\n您要使用什么支付方式呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "msg_restaurant01_03",
      "hash64": "DBD952BDDF966845",
      "text": "我明白了！\\n请稍等片刻！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "msg_restaurant01_04",
      "hash64": "DBD94BBDDF965C60",
      "text": "谢谢您的惠顾！\\n还请多多光临！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "msg_restaurant01_05",
      "hash64": "DBD94CBDDF965E13",
      "text": "……您的钱不够啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "msg_restaurant01_06",
      "hash64": "DBD94DBDDF965FC6",
      "text": "……您的ＬＰ不够啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "msg_restaurant02_00",
      "hash64": "B2A159C92A13E67B",
      "text": "欢迎光临！\\n这里是九八酒吧哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "msg_restaurant02_01",
      "hash64": "B2A158C92A13E4C8",
      "text": "你是要点\\n[VAR 0x01CF(0000)]吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "01CF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "msg_restaurant02_02",
      "hash64": "B2A15BC92A13E9E1",
      "text": "现在的食力将会被覆盖哦。\\n你想用什么支付方式呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "msg_restaurant02_03",
      "hash64": "B2A15AC92A13E82E",
      "text": "知道了！\\n稍等一下哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "msg_restaurant02_04",
      "hash64": "B2A15DC92A13ED47",
      "text": "你吃得真香！\\n下次要再来吃哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "msg_restaurant02_05",
      "hash64": "B2A15CC92A13EB94",
      "text": "……哎呀，你钱不够哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "msg_restaurant02_06",
      "hash64": "B2A15FC92A13F0AD",
      "text": "……哎呀，你ＬＰ不够哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "msg_restaurant03_00",
      "hash64": "DEA863CF8B7DFC2A",
      "text": "感谢你的光临！\\n这里是顶新鲜餐厅！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "msg_restaurant03_01",
      "hash64": "DEA864CF8B7DFDDD",
      "text": "是要[VAR 0x01CF(0000)]\\n没错吧！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "01CF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "msg_restaurant03_02",
      "hash64": "DEA861CF8B7DF8C4",
      "text": "现在的食力会覆盖哦。\\n你要用哪种支付方式呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "msg_restaurant03_03",
      "hash64": "DEA862CF8B7DFA77",
      "text": "已收到你的点餐！\\n十分乐意为你服务！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "msg_restaurant03_04",
      "hash64": "DEA85FCF8B7DF55E",
      "text": "谢谢惠顾！\\n期待你再次光临哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "msg_restaurant03_05",
      "hash64": "DEA860CF8B7DF711",
      "text": "……哎哟！你的钱不够呀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "msg_restaurant03_06",
      "hash64": "DEA85DCF8B7DF1F8",
      "text": "……哎哟！你的ＬＰ不够呀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "msg_restaurant04_00",
      "hash64": "895E8DD99A8A09D9",
      "text": "这里是满载东方魅力的\\n回转OSUSHI餐厅\\r\\n回转梦想家哟！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "msg_restaurant04_01",
      "hash64": "895E8CD99A8A0826",
      "text": "[VAR 0x01CF(0000)]啊！\\n你钱包能顶得住吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "01CF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "msg_restaurant04_02",
      "hash64": "895E8BD99A8A0673",
      "text": "现在的食力可会被覆盖！\\n你要用怎样的支付方式支付！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "msg_restaurant04_03",
      "hash64": "895E8AD99A8A04C0",
      "text": "好咧，收到了！！\\n一位客人大驾光临！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "msg_restaurant04_04",
      "hash64": "895E91D99A8A10A5",
      "text": "感谢你的惠顾！\\n好走不送！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "msg_restaurant04_05",
      "hash64": "895E90D99A8A0EF2",
      "text": "……你的钱不够！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "msg_restaurant04_06",
      "hash64": "895E8FD99A8A0D3F",
      "text": "……你的ＬＰ不够！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "msg_restaurant05_00",
      "hash64": "B71897DFFD65B408",
      "text": "欢迎光临\\n回转梦想家！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "msg_restaurant05_01",
      "hash64": "B71898DFFD65B5BB",
      "text": "要点[VAR 0x01CF(0000)]\\n是吧！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "01CF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "msg_restaurant05_02",
      "hash64": "B71899DFFD65B76E",
      "text": "食力会像积雪一样被覆盖。\\n你要怎么样支付呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "msg_restaurant05_03",
      "hash64": "B7189ADFFD65B921",
      "text": "让我将你带领到\\n如雪融于舌尖的美味最高境界！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "msg_restaurant05_04",
      "hash64": "B7189BDFFD65BAD4",
      "text": "期待你的\\n再次光临！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "msg_restaurant05_05",
      "hash64": "B7189CDFFD65BC87",
      "text": "……你的钱不够，\\n这可是不行的哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "msg_restaurant05_06",
      "hash64": "B7189DDFFD65BE3A",
      "text": "……你的ＬＰ不够，\\n这可是不行的哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "msg_restaurant06_00",
      "hash64": "0D7E61E798CF7477",
      "text": "嗨，欢迎～欢迎～！\\n你来吃美味的料理啦？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "msg_restaurant06_01",
      "hash64": "0D7E60E798CF72C4",
      "text": "你要[VAR 0x01CF(0000)]\\n是吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "01CF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "msg_restaurant06_02",
      "hash64": "0D7E63E798CF77DD",
      "text": "食力将会被覆盖哦。\\n请问要选哪种支付方式呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "msg_restaurant06_03",
      "hash64": "0D7E62E798CF762A",
      "text": "好的，谢谢！\\n已收到你的点单咯！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "msg_restaurant06_04",
      "hash64": "0D7E5DE798CF6DAB",
      "text": "客人们吃得真香！\\n要再来吃哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "msg_restaurant06_05",
      "hash64": "0D7E5CE798CF6BF8",
      "text": "……不够钱可不行哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "msg_restaurant06_06",
      "hash64": "0D7E5FE798CF7111",
      "text": "……不够ＬＰ可不行哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "msg_restaurant07_00",
      "hash64": "E2934BF2E1DB2CE6",
      "text": "欢迎光临，\\n请问是来用餐的吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "msg_restaurant07_01",
      "hash64": "E2934CF2E1DB2E99",
      "text": "请问您决定点的是\\n[VAR 0x01CF(0000)]吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "01CF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "msg_restaurant07_02",
      "hash64": "E29349F2E1DB2980",
      "text": "现在的食力将会被新的所取代。\\n请问您希望怎样支付呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "msg_restaurant07_03",
      "hash64": "E2934AF2E1DB2B33",
      "text": "我知道了，\\n希望您能度过一段优雅时光。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "msg_restaurant07_04",
      "hash64": "E2934FF2E1DB33B2",
      "text": "衷心期盼您\\n再次光临本店。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "msg_restaurant07_05",
      "hash64": "E29350F2E1DB3565",
      "text": "……这位客人，\\n请您确认一下您持有的金额。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "msg_restaurant07_06",
      "hash64": "E2934DF2E1DB304C",
      "text": "……这位客人，\\n请您确认一下您的ＬＰ。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
